### [How it works](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kinesisvideostreams/latest/dg/how-it-works.md)

Overview of how you can stream video from devices to the AWS Cloud using Kinesis Video Streams.

- [API and producer libraries](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kinesisvideostreams/latest/dg/how-it-works-kinesis-video-api-producer-sdk.md): Use the Kinesis Video Streams APIs to create and manage video streams and read or write data to and from a video stream.
- [Data model](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kinesisvideostreams/latest/dg/how-data.md): Description of the model Kinesis Video Streams uses to store and read data.
