- [Quotas](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kinesisvideostreams/latest/dg/limits.md): API service quotas for Amazon Kinesis Video Streams.
- [Tiered Storage](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kinesisvideostreams/latest/dg/tiered-storage.md): Information about tiered storage for Kinesis Video Streams.
